// Opening the cupboard makes a lantern inside it, whose `lamp` is the
// hall's, the nearest round the cupboard, and kindles the beacon in the world,
// which the world's name fixes from anywhere.
kind Cupboard {
  contains

  as target for open {
    do {
      spawn Lantern in self
      send instance_scope.beacon :kindle
      say "A lantern is waiting on the top shelf."
    }
  }
}
